        'Diagnostic Virology Methods: Specimen handling (Dacron swabs, 4°C or -70°C, avoid -20°C); CPE light microscopy, shell-vial culture, RT-PCR panels.',
        'Cytopathic Effects (CPE): Cowdry type A inclusions (HSV/VZV), Koilocytes (HPV), Negri bodies (Rabies), Syncytia (RSV).',
